%Docstring
Sets the way the vectors are stored in the raster bands.

.. seealso:: :py:func:`sourceMode`
%End

    int directionBand() const;
%Docstring
Returns the band which holds the coded compass directions, used when the
:py:func:`~QgsRasterVectorFieldRenderer.sourceMode` is
:py:class:`Qgis`.RasterVectorFieldSourceMode.EncodedDirection.

.. seealso:: :py:func:`setDirectionBand`
%End

    bool setDirectionBand( int band );
%Docstring
Attempts to set the ``band`` which holds the coded compass directions.

Returns ``True`` if the band was successfully set.

.. seealso:: :py:func:`directionBand`
%End

